greeks-fortran is a modern Fortran translation of the computational portions
of the R package greeks 1.5.6.

Original package:
  greeks: Sensitivities of Prices of Financial Options and Implied Volatilities
  Author: Anselm Hudde
  Copyright (c) 2023 greeks authors
  License: MIT

The original source package is retained unmodified under original/ and the
supplied archive is retained under provenance/. The Fortran translation keeps
the MIT license and original attribution. Shiny, plotly, ggplot2, tibble,
tidyr, magrittr, Rcpp registration, and R presentation infrastructure are not
part of the compiled Fortran library.
